      "website": "https://championeffect.com/home",
      "all_locations": "San Francisco, CA, USA",
      "long_description": "ChampionEffect is an AI Coach that teaches AI to every employee at a company, in Slack and Teams.\r\n\r\nCoach helps with a new AI concept, a new workflow or any tool. It jumps on a call and walks you through the work, just like a coworker would. It points to the top use cases in your industry and tailors everything to your company’s needs and tools. Every time someone does a walkthrough with Coach, it learns from it and suggests a better way to the next coworker.\r\n\r\nBefore this, we ran a YC company (Cambly) that taught English to millions of professionals and generated $100M+ in revenue. Now we’re using what we learned to teach millions about AI.",
